	(text_box " WIRING (VIA port A; change the three PAD_..._BIT masks below if you wire it\n; differently).  The pad's +5V and GND go to the supply:\n;       PA0  <-  DATA   (pad pin \"Data\", needs a pull-up resistor, 10k to +5V)\n;       PA1  ->  LATCH\n;       PA2  ->  CLOCK"
